<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kalonga Masula</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">early 17th century</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kalonga Masula was a ruler of the Maravi confederacy, in what is now <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malawi">Malawi</a>, in the early 17th century. He extended Maravi power towards the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indian-ocean">Indian Ocean</a> coast and brought the Lundu kingdom back under Maravi overlordship, and aided the Portuguese against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zimba">Zimba</a>. After his death the confederacy loosened into rival chiefdoms.</p></div>
